                    <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="review-text">"Menyu juda interaktiv va qulay. QR kod orqali taomlarni ko'rish va tanlash jarayoni menga juda yoqdi!"</p>
                    <div class="reviewer">
                        <div class="reviewer-avatar">J</div>
                        <div><div class="reviewer-name">Jasur R.</div><div class="reviewer-role">Doimiy mijoz</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="review-text">"Atmosfera va taomlar ajoyib. Organik mahsulotlardan tayyorlangani seziladi."</p>
                    <div class="reviewer">
                        <div class="reviewer-avatar">M</div>
                        <div><div class="reviewer-name">Madina A.</div><div class="reviewer-role">Restoran muxlisi</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
                    <p class="review-text">"Yangi texnologiyalardan foydalanishgani judayam yaxshi. Taomlar mazali."</p>
                    <div class="reviewer">
                        <div class="reviewer-avatar">T</div>
                        <div><div class="reviewer-name">Temur K.</div><div class="reviewer-role">Birinchi marta</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="cta-section">
        <h2>Restoranimizga kelishga tayyormisiz?</h2>
        <p>Hoziroq menyu bilan tanishing va stolingizni band qiling. MossMenu sizni kutmoqda!</p>
        <a href="/menu" class="btn-cta">Menyuni Ochish</a>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-grid">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <a href="/" class="logo-wrap" style="display: inline-flex; text-decoration: none;">
                    <svg width="155" height="38" viewBox="0 0 155 38">
                        <rect x="0" y="0" width="155" height="38" rx="19" fill="#c8622a"/>
                        <circle cx="21" cy="19" r="14" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"/>
                        <line x1="16" y1="10" x2="16" y2="28" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <line x1="14" y1="10" x2="14" y2="16" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
