                        <line x1="24" y1="10" x2="24" y2="28" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path d="M24 10 Q30 13 30 18 Q30 23 24 23" fill="white"/>
                        <text x="40" y="25" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="white" font-style="italic">MossMenu</text>
                    </svg>
                </a>
                <p>Bringing the freshness of nature to your table. Experience organic dining with our moss-themed culinary journey.</p>
                <div class="social-links">
